    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 38.162, 688.192, 290.11, 711.063 ],
    "font" : "MinionPro-Regular",
    "font size" : 8.8,
    "text color" : "[0.75, 0.68, 0.67, 0.902]",
    "content" : " e CyQUANT® cell proliferation assay has a number of signi cant advantages over other proliferation assays:"
  }, {
    "type" : "list",
    "pdfua_tag" : "L",
    "id" : 27,
    "level" : "2",
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 41.155, 347.192, 290.169, 678.371 ],
    "numbering style" : "unordered",
    "number of list items" : 5,
    "list items" : [ {
      "type" : "list item",
      "pdfua_tag" : "LI",
      "page number" : 1,
      "bounding box" : [ 41.162, 589.192, 290.168, 678.371 ],
      "font" : "MinionPro-Regular",
      "font size" : 8.8,
      "text color" : "[0.75, 0.68, 0.67, 0.902]",
      "content" : "• Sensitivity and linearity.  e CyQUANT® assay is linear from 50 or fewer cells to at least 50,000 cells in 200 µL volumes (Figure 15.4.12); increasing the dye concentration extends the linear range to at least 250,000 cells. Methods that employ Hoechst 3325866 (H1398, H3569, H21491) or Hoechst 3334267 (H1399, H3570, H21492) to measure cell number and proliferation are much less sensitive—detection limits of 500 cells for Hoechst 3325866 or 2500 cells for Hoechst 3334267—and have much smaller e ective ranges.",
      "kids" : [ ]
    }, {
      "type" : "list item",
      "pdfua_tag" : "LI",
      "page number" : 1,
      "bounding box" : [ 41.162, 545.192, 290.159, 590.977 ],
      "font" : "MinionPro-Regular",
      "font size" : 8.8,
      "text color" : "[0.75, 0.68, 0.67, 0.902]",
      "content" : "• No radioactivity. Unlike assays that measure3H-thymidine incorporation, the CyQUANT® assay does not require radioisotopes and thus does not have the hazards or the expense associated with use, storage and disposal of radioisotopes.",
      "kids" : [ ]
    }, {
      "type" : "list item",
      "pdfua_tag" : "LI",
      "page number" : 1,
      "bounding box" : [ 41.155, 512.192, 290.169, 546.371 ],
      "font" : "MinionPro-Regular",
      "font size" : 8.8,
      "text color" : "[0.75, 0.68, 0.67, 0.902]",
      "content" : "• Quick and easy protocol.  e CyQUANT® assay is a single-step procedure that requires no lengthy incubation steps and can be completed within an hour (Figure 15.4.11).",
      "kids" : [ ]
    }, {
      "type" : "list item",
      "pdfua_tag" : "LI",
      "page number" : 1,
      "bounding box" : [ 41.158, 435.192, 290.144, 513.371 ],
      "font" : "MinionPro-Regular",
      "font size" : 8.8,
      "text color" : "[0.75, 0.68, 0.67, 0.902]",
      "content" : "• Speci city and reliability.  e assay is speci c for total nucleic acids, with essentially no interference from other cell components. No wash steps are required because cellular growth media do not signi cantly interfere with CyQUANT® GR  uorescence.  e CyQUANT® assay is reliable for cell quantitation, even without treatment to eliminate cellular RNA. However, addition of RNase or DNase permits the easy quantitation of DNA or RNA, respectively, in the sample.",
      "kids" : [ ]
    }, {
      "type" : "list item",
      "pdfua_tag" : "LI",
      "page number" : 1,
      "bounding box" : [ 41.158, 347.192, 290.16, 436.977 ],
      "font" : "MinionPro-Regular",
      "font size" : 8.8,
      "text color" : "[0.75, 0.68, 0.67, 0.902]",
      "content" : "• Convenience. Unlike assays that use tetrazolium salts,3H-thymidine, BrdU, neutral red or methylene blue,67–70 the CyQUANT® procedure is not dependent on cellular metabolism.  us, cells can be frozen and stored prior to assaying, with no reduction in signal, or they can be assayed immediately a er collection. Time-course assays are simpli ed because data obtained from stored samples taken at widely di erent time intervals can be assayed together with a single standard curve determination.",
      "kids" : [ ]
    } ]
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 28,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 38.158, 314.192, 290.154, 337.063 ],
    "font" : "MinionPro-Regular",
    "font size" : 8.8,
    "text color" : "[0.75, 0.68, 0.67, 0.902]",
    "content" : "We have found the CyQUANT® Cell Proliferation Assay Kit to be useful for assaying widely disparate cell types, including:"
  }, {
