    "font" : "MinionPro-Regular",
    "font size" : 8.8,
    "text color" : "[0.75, 0.68, 0.67, 0.902]",
    "content" : "Determination of total cell number using the CyQUANT® GR reagent is potentially useful for quantitating cell adhesion (see “Cell Adhesion” in Section 15.6) and for determining the total number of cells in a tissue. Each CyQUANT® Cell Proliferation Assay Kit (C7026) includes:"
